{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31371","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作二首 二 · 于瓌","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"极目郡城楼，浮云拂槛愁。\n政成多暇日，诗思动先秋。\n远霁千岩雪，随波一叶舟。\n昔曾窥粉绘，今愿许陪游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于瓌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}